n| 2026-10-30 04:43 | 2.0 | Restored a single tab control after duplicated bilingual link IDs broke navigation; machine selection now offers Azure Arc only. English/Português guidance remains available. Queries, machines and licenses unchanged. | `25747d8c45bc407eab941e6d186bdf8b` |\n| 2026-10-30 04:38 | 1.9 | Added English/Português selection and localized editorial content; tab control regression identified and superseded by 2.0. | `e4d1ca5795344342bc6d4ad34a068caa` |\n| 2026-10-30 04:17 | 1.8 | Marked Azure Arc as the dropdown default with selected=true and added optional All items (Arc + Azure VM) for six instance-derived views. Arc-only evidence stays Arc-scoped in All; version breakdown now identifies the source. Updated scope guidance. No servers or licenses changed. | `ad59b023f6654d4a88f4b0e7f35ac80b` |\n| 2026-10-30 04:02 | 1.7 | Fixed the External validations editorial note visibility: SelectedTab isEqualTo now compares the scalar Validation rather than the obsolete Validation/NewQueryItem array. No query, license or server changed. | `ae63d04d0b044533a9935de9b02418cb` |\n| 2026-10-30 03:39 | 1.6 | Fixed two source-filter leaks found by executing the queries: architecture now requires an Arc machine container ID, and auto-deploy tags apply the Arc-only guard after both union branches. Other queries and licensing resources unchanged. | `630bd6ea957b425da5f0e038927746a5` |\n| 2026-10-30 03:27 | 1.5 | Added Machine source control (Azure Arc default, Azure VM optional): filtered six instance-derived views by container resource type and kept seven Arc-only evidence views empty for Azure VM selection. Added scope guidance; no server or licensing configuration changed. | `42e40b2896c040af937b1f551203e776` |\n| 2026-10-30 03:15 | 1.4 | Replaced the permanent Change log tab with an edit-mode Show changelog Yes/No control (default No; hidden when locked); moved this text item beneath the controls. No KQL or licensing guidance changed. | `dd717b54a62242e6b822e5552f1